{"id":844624,"title":"23｜需求设计、示意图设计","content":"本课程介绍了商城微信小程序项目的整体设计与规划。项目包含三个子项目：前端微信小程序、后端API服务和后台管理系统。为简化开发流程，后台管理系统采用前后端一体的方式，使用Node.js作为基础框架。前端部分基于微信小程序原生框架构建，数据库统一使用MySQL。项目需求包括首页、分类、购物车和个人中心四大功能模块。首页展示轮播图、推荐商品列表及分类商品列表；分类页面显示分类图片和名称，并可跳转至分类商品列表；购物车页面支持全选、数量调整、删除及结算功能；个人中心页面提供订单管理和收货地址管理。每个页面下方设有导航菜单，便于用户切换。在生成代码前，通过内嵌对话框自动生成后台管理系统功能需求及对应的API服务定义。最后，利用手绘草图和自动生成的UI示意图完成前端页面的设计。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":399156,"user_name":"Geek_60fda3","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3804624,"ip_address":"江西","ucode":"10588B81C26E1C","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEKqegC9wxhExMC1FaibjX91ojfytsTExtnicClWibCiarK9nOTkSoyTFptSQmrjEubry34seBIehxiaT962jFOzf9OCicBp0x5U2QYym62MIiakbWerA/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1743320086,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144864,"content":"课件下载：\nhttps:&#47;&#47;pan.baidu.com&#47;s&#47;1K9luFlq-12Hz61zXlAWaVw 提取码: xktr","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1743407606,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":399156,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"源码在哪里呀","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":659138,"discussion_content":"课件下载：\nhttps://pan.baidu.com/s/1K9luFlq-12Hz61zXlAWaVw 提取码: xktr","content_length":63,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1743407606,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}